The benchmark daily admission gates are absolute IC ≥ **0.0070** and absolute ICIR ≥ **0.0840**. Neither candidate passed both daily gates. The volatility-normalized reversal exceeded the IC threshold, but its daily ICIR was only **0.03891** and its effective sample was limited to approximately 100 dates, all in 2026. The strong 10-day result is not eligible for daily-factor admission.

A script API issue involving `rolling/expanding` arguments was corrected using an equivalent rolling-rank implementation. No look-ahead data was introduced; signals were lagged to use only completed observations.

